{"seq":6,"slug":"crypto-asset-allocation","title":"加密资产配置","stage":"DONE","category":"personal-finance-investing","chapterCount":4,"docCount":10,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.38,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"加密资产配置\">加密资产配置</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>加密资产配置是个人投资组合管理中的新兴领域，研究如何将比特币、以太坊等加密资产纳入传统投资组合，在风险可控的前提下获取非对称收益。本 Hub 覆盖从基础认知到实操层面的完整知识体系——理解加密资产的资产属性，掌握组合整合方法论，评估 DeFi 收益机会，以及建立安全与合规框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识结构\">知识结构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[加密资产配置] --&gt; B[加密资产基础]&#10;    A --&gt; C[组合整合]&#10;    A --&gt; D[DeFi 收益]&#10;    A --&gt; E[风险与托管]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[比特币作为资产类别]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[以太坊与智能合约经济]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[代币经济学]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[配置比例决策]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[相关性体制变化]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[加密资产再平衡]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; D1[质押与流动性质押]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[借贷协议]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[流动性挖矿与风险]&#10;&#10;    E --&gt; E1[托管方案]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[安全最佳实践]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[监管格局]&#10;\">graph TD\n    A[加密资产配置] --&gt; B[加密资产基础]\n    A --&gt; C[组合整合]\n    A --&gt; D[DeFi 收益]\n    A --&gt; E[风险与托管]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[比特币作为资产类别]\n    B --&gt; B2[以太坊与智能合约经济]\n    B --&gt; B3[代币经济学]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[配置比例决策]\n    C --&gt; C2[相关性体制变化]\n    C --&gt; C3[加密资产再平衡]\n\n    D --&gt; D1[质押与流动性质押]\n    D --&gt; D2[借贷协议]\n    D --&gt; D3[流动性挖矿与风险]\n\n    E --&gt; E1[托管方案]\n    E --&gt; E2[安全最佳实践]\n    E --&gt; E3[监管格局]\n</pre><h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>加密资产基础</strong>：理解比特币的「数字黄金」叙事与机构化进程，掌握以太坊作为生产性资产的收益逻辑，建立代币经济学分析框架</li>\n<li><strong>组合整合</strong>：学习 1%-5% 配置框架的理论依据，理解加密资产与传统资产的相关性动态，掌握高波动环境下的再平衡策略</li>\n<li><strong>DeFi 收益</strong>：从质押/再质押到借贷协议，系统评估链上收益来源及其风险收益特征</li>\n<li><strong>风险与托管</strong>：建立完整的安全实践体系，理解全球监管格局及合规路径</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"适用读者\">适用读者</h2><ul>\n<li>已有传统投资组合、希望了解加密资产配置可行性的投资者</li>\n<li>对 DeFi 收益感兴趣但缺乏系统风险认知的加密用户</li>\n<li>需要建立加密资产安全管理框架的个人投资者</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>基本的投资组合理论（资产配置、分散化、风险收益权衡）</li>\n<li>对区块链基本概念的初步了解（区块、交易、钱包地址）</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crypto-fundamentals","title":"加密资产基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/crypto-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bitcoin-as-asset-class","title":"比特币作为资产类别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/crypto-fundamentals/bitcoin-as-asset-class"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ethereum-ecosystem","title":"以太坊与智能合约经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/crypto-fundamentals/ethereum-ecosystem"},{"seq":3,"slug":"token-economics","title":"代币经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/crypto-fundamentals/token-economics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"portfolio-integration","title":"组合整合","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/portfolio-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"allocation-sizing","title":"配置比例决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/portfolio-integration/allocation-sizing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"correlation-regime","title":"相关性体制变化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/portfolio-integration/correlation-regime"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rebalancing-crypto","title":"加密资产再平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/portfolio-integration/rebalancing-crypto"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"defi-yield","title":"DeFi 收益","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/defi-yield","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"staking-liquid-staking","title":"质押与流动性质押","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/defi-yield/staking-liquid-staking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lending-borrowing","title":"借贷协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/defi-yield/lending-borrowing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"yield-farming-risks","title":"流动性挖矿与风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/defi-yield/yield-farming-risks"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"risk-custody","title":"风险与托管","docCount":1,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/risk-custody","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"custody-solutions","title":"托管方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/risk-custody/custody-solutions"}]}]}